OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist seriously injured in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has suffered serious
OL,7,Finjuries after a collision with a car.
OL,9,FA blue Keeway Ezi Mini electric
OL,10,Fmotorcycle and a silver Peugeot 206
OL,11,Fcrashed on the A47 westbound between
OL,12,Fthe Peterborough City Hospital and
OL,13,FThorpe Wood junctions at about 13:15
OL,14,FGMT on Thursday, Cambridgeshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe motorcyclist, a 66-year-old man
OL,18,Ffrom Peterborough, suffered serious
OL,19,Finjuries and was taken to Addenbrooke's
OL,20,FHospital in Cambridge.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
